### 2. GET /prowallet/whitelist - Get Whitelist
### ============================================================================
### Lista de wallets whitelisteadas

GET {{@api}}/prowallet/whitelist

### Response should be 200 OK with array of whitelisted wallets


### ============================================================================
### 3. GET /prowallet/whitelist/:wallet - Check Wallet Whitelist Status
### ============================================================================
### Verifica si un wallet está en whitelist

GET {{@api}}/prowallet/whitelist/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8

### Response should be 200 OK with:
### {
###   "success": true,
###   "wallet": "4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8",
###   "whitelisted": true,
###   "addedAt": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
### }


