### ============================================================================
### 7. GET /prowallet/transfers - Get Recent Transfers
### ============================================================================
### Transferencias recientes del token

GET {{@api}}/prowallet/transfers?limit=20

### Response should be 200 OK with array of transfers


### ============================================================================
### 8. GET /prowallet/transfers/:wallet - Get Wallet Transfers
### ============================================================================
### Transferencias de un wallet específico

GET {{@api}}/prowallet/transfers/4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8?limit=20

